t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与苹果前高管联合申请永久驳回苹果商业秘密窃取诉讼</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Midjourney正式上线V8.2图像编辑模型，支持指令微调与画布扩展</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布模型硬件标准MHS，正式进军具身智能与物理AI领域</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布全新 Qoder：将 AI 编程 IDE 升级为面向全员的智能体工作台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/09bcf9a64753367ba069c7a1f7b80e38.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">8月27日，阿里正式发布全新 Qoder，将原有的 AI 编程 IDE 升级为以 Coding 为底座、面向所有人的智能体工作台。该平台搭载 Harness 长链路执行底座，支持“读—改—验证—迭代”的自主闭环，具备跨文件编辑、测试执行、自纠错及长期记忆等能力。技术上内置海内外 SOTA 模型并深度适配 Qwen 系列，通过 Auto 智能路由优化效果与成本。产品提供编程与通用双模式，支持 40+ 连接器、70+ 插件及 20K+ 技能，打通代码库、项目管理及云系统，并具备 Browser Use 与 Computer Use 能力。此次升级标志着工作范式从“亲自生产”转向“委派与验收”，用户群体从专业程序员扩展至产品、运营等非技术人员。即日起至9月1日，个人版可领 2500 Qwen Credits，企业版使</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布770B旗舰模型Hy4preview并正式开源，支持1M上下文长度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f10b20ccca5c57985cdeb65a0b1f2992.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元团队正式发布全新一代旗舰模型预览版Hy4preview，该模型总参数量达770B，激活参数为49B，并支持1M上下文长度。Hy4preview在代码开发、办公分析、游戏生成及科学研究等生产力场景表现卓越，内部盲测综合性能优于同类竞品。在技术优化方面，该模型通过自主定位推理系统瓶颈，实现端到端吞吐量较基线提升31.8%。在科学探索领域，它在机器学习力场分子动力学模拟、凝聚态物理器件设计及三维Blaschke–Lebesgue几何难题上均取得显著突破。目前，Hy4preview已全面开源，并上线腾讯云TokenHub与OpenRouter平台，用户可通过元宝、ima等产品进行体验。腾讯混元团队将基于社区反馈加速模型迭代，持续推进正式版升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与苹果前高管联合申请永久驳回苹果商业秘密窃取诉讼</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cf14f2030f6c7ab1f5117bbe659e7142.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI联合苹果前高管唐坦、刘畅及io Products向法院提交请愿书，请求“带偏见地驳回”苹果提起的商业秘密窃取诉讼，旨在彻底阻止苹果未来就相同事由再次起诉。此前，苹果指控上述人员在跳槽至OpenAI及io Products期间非法获取并泄露公司机密，并试图规避安保审查。OpenAI在最新回应中指出，苹果的诉状存在根本性事实缺陷，未能根据《保护商业秘密法》（DTSA）清晰界定商业秘密或提供确凿的非法挪用证据，仅依赖主观推测。目前双方已完成诉辩状提交，法院定于10月1日召开动议听证会。此案核心争议在于顶尖软硬件人才流动中的技术合规边界，其裁决结果将对硅谷人才流动机制及AI生态中的知识产权保护标准产生深远影响，标志着科技巨头与AI新锐在核心技术产权博弈上的进一步升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Midjourney正式上线V8.2图像编辑模型，支持指令微调与画布扩展</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ee1ede5743f536d7e046c8acad8c0b4c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Midjourney近日正式发布V8.2图像编辑模型并开启测试，标志着其从单一文本生成向精准图像编辑的重大转型。该模型核心功能包括：支持通过文本指令直接修改图像；引入多图参考机制，单次最多融合4张图片；提供局部重绘（inpainting）与画布扩展（outpainting）功能。此外，V8.2全面兼容个性化设置、情绪板及风格参考（srefs）。用户可通过官网主站、alpha.midjourney.com或Discord频道调用，支持拖拽图片至提示词框或点击“编辑”按钮操作。官方表示，该版本处于测试初期，界面将高频迭代，并鼓励用户通过任务ID反馈复杂边缘情况下的生成表现。此次更新旨在为创作者提供更具可控性的专业级视觉创作工具，通过深度融合多项前沿技术，显著提升了AI绘画在复杂工作流中的应用深度。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布模型硬件标准MHS，正式进军具身智能与物理AI领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4c5210c4ae4e9870b5fe8584c0f7bf48.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于8月27日以研究预览形式推出模型硬件标准（MHS），标志其正式切入具身智能与物理AI赛道。MHS本质是一套统一的控制与通信标准，旨在为AI智能体提供“翻译层”，使其能够直接操控具备可编程接口的物理设备。通过该标准，AI代理可在无需人工干预的情况下，同时调度显微镜、液体处理器、机械臂及量子计算设备，实现全天候自主作业。在生物医药、量子计算及先进制造等领域的早期闭门测试中，MHS表现出显著的提速效应。以制药巨头基因泰克为例，通过赋予AI直接操控多台异构实验设备的能力，其全自动剂量反应曲线实验的开发与运行周期缩短至原来的三分之一。此次发布意味着Anthropic将大模型应用场景从数字世界的对话交互，正式拓展至实体产线的物理执行层面。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
